  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nWith the latest update to the VRChat website we can now change the name of your Avatar Favorites. Changing the name though is not reflected in the in-game UI, there the default names will be used. There is also currently no way to change the name of your Avatar Favorite lists in-game.\n# Suggestion:\nUse the name that we can define on the VRChat website and also allow us to change it in-game. This would allow us to better sort our Avatars and would also make the in-game Favorites more consistent with the website Favorties.\n# Attachments:\nIn the first picture you can see that I changed the names of my Favorite Lists on the website and in the second one you can see that those aren't used in-game:",
